      "body": {
        "hints": [
          "<p>The value of each place is 10 times the value of the place to its right.</p>\n<p>The value of each place is <img class=\"Wirisformula\" style=\"max-width: none; vertical-align: -22px;\" role=\"math\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;charset=utf8,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20xmlns%3Awrs%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.wiris.com%2Fxml%2Fcvs-extension%22%20height%3D%2259%22%20width%3D%2239%22%20wrs%3Abaseline%3D%2237%22%3E%3C!--MathML%3A%20%3Cmath%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F1998%2FMath%2FMathML%22%3E%3Cmfrac%3E%3Cmn%3E1%3C%2Fmn%3E%3Cmn%3E10%3C%2Fmn%3E%3C%2Fmfrac%3E%3C%2Fmath%3E--%3E%3Cdefs%3E%3Cstyle%20type%3D%22text%2Fcss%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fdefs%3E%3Cline%20stroke%3D%22%23000000%22%20stroke-linecap%3D%22square%22%20stroke-width%3D%221%22%20x1%3D%223.5%22%20x2%3D%2234.5%22%20y1%3D%2229.5%22%20y2%3D%2229.5%22%2F%3E%3Ctext%20font-family%3D%22Signika%22%20font-size%3D%2222%22%20text-anchor%3D%22middle%22%20x%3D%2219.5%22%20y%3D%2220%22%3E1%3C%2Ftext%3E%3Ctext%20font-family%3D%22Signika%22%20font-size%3D%2222%22%20text-anchor%3D%22middle%22%20x%3D%2219.5%22%20y%3D%2252%22%3E10%3C%2Ftext%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" alt=\"1 over 10\" width=\"39\" height=\"59\" align=\"middle\" data-mathml=\"«math xmlns=¨http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML¨»«mfrac»«mn»1«/mn»«mn»10«/mn»«/mfrac»«/math»\" />&nbsp;of the value of the place to its left.</p>",
          "<p>8 in the tenths place is 10 times as much as 8 in the hundredths place.</p>"
        ],
        "generalFeedback": "<p>The value of each place is 10 times the value of the place to its right. <img style=\"float: right;\" src=\"../alef-assessment-content/data/ccl/assessment/questions/2022/05/28/12/05/1YqgQpQqTO.jpg\" width=\"401\" height=\"202\" />&nbsp;</p>\n<p>So, in number 3.882, the digit 8 in the tenths place is 10 times as much as 8 in the hundredths place.</p>\n<p>The value of each place is <img class=\"Wirisformula\" style=\"max-width: none; vertical-align: -22px;\" role=\"math\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;charset=utf8,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20xmlns%3Awrs%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.wiris.com%2Fxml%2Fcvs-extension%22%20height%3D%2259%22%20width%3D%2239%22%20wrs%3Abaseline%3D%2237%22%3E%3C!--MathML%3A%20%3Cmath%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F1998%2FMath%2FMathML%22%3E%3Cmfrac%3E%3Cmn%3E1%3C%2Fmn%3E%3Cmn%3E10%3C%2Fmn%3E%3C%2Fmfrac%3E%3C%2Fmath%3E--%3E%3Cdefs%3E%3Cstyle%20type%3D%22text%2Fcss%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fdefs%3E%3Cline%20stroke%3D%22%23000000%22%20stroke-linecap%3D%22square%22%20stroke-width%3D%221%22%20x1%3D%223.5%22%20x2%3D%2234.5%22%20y1%3D%2229.5%22%20y2%3D%2229.5%22%2F%3E%3Ctext%20font-family%3D%22Signika%22%20font-size%3D%2222%22%20text-anchor%3D%22middle%22%20x%3D%2219.5%22%20y%3D%2220%22%3E1%3C%2Ftext%3E%3Ctext%20font-family%3D%22Signika%22%20font-size%3D%2222%22%20text-anchor%3D%22middle%22%20x%3D%2219.5%22%20y%3D%2252%22%3E10%3C%2Ftext%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" alt=\"1 over 10\" width=\"39\" height=\"59\" align=\"middle\" data-mathml=\"«math xmlns=¨http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML¨»«mfrac»«mn»1«/mn»«mn»10«/mn»«/mfrac»«/math»\" /> of the value of the place to its left.</p>\n<p>So, in number 3.882, 8 in the hundredths place is <img class=\"Wirisformula\" style=\"max-width: none; vertical-align: -22px;\" role=\"math\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;charset=utf8,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20xmlns%3Awrs%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.wiris.com%2Fxml%2Fcvs-extension%22%20height%3D%2259%22%20widt